[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_STRATUSBURG_SURVEY]
Is that word a place?

[en.FOCUS_C01_C04_STRATUSBURG_SURVEY_desc]
§g“The Empress’s latest order says that we EEMO should collect information on Stratusburg and consider advertising for conscription?”§!\n“Sure... Wait, what? Stra-tus-burg? Is that word a place? I have no impression of it at all.”

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_STRATUSBURG_SURVEY]
那是个地名吗？

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C04_STRATUSBURG_SURVEY_desc]
§g“女皇最新的命令，说让我们秩序部收集层云堡的信息，并且考虑推动征兵宣传？”§!\n“好的... 等等，啥？层... 云堡？那是个地名吗？我怎么一点印象都没有。”

